    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
    "body": "I'll get us started.\r\n\r\n- The colorscheme is [`miniwinter`](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-hues.html#minihues-color-schemes)\r\n- The greeting changes from \"morning\", \"day\", and \"evening\" (\"borrowed\" from @echasnovski, thank you)\r\n- The quote at the bottom is from `fortune` and changes on startup\r\n- My `mini.starter` [config](https://github.com/pkazmier/nvim/blob/2849b173b085201aaa43383116d23e095764e894/plugin/mini/00_mini.starter.lua) with my new logo\r\n\r\n<img width=\"795\" height=\"914\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-09 at 9 18 29 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8f055bd-fc78-43f5-9fd3-ceff173b3cc6\" />\r\n\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'll get us started.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The colorscheme is <a href=\"https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-hues.html#minihues-color-schemes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">miniwinter</code></a></li>\n<li>The greeting changes from \"morning\", \"day\", and \"evening\" (\"borrowed\" from <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/echasnovski/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski\">@echasnovski</a>, thank you)</li>\n<li>The quote at the bottom is from <code class=\"notranslate\">fortune</code> and changes on startup</li>\n<li>My <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.starter</code> <a href=\"https://github.com/pkazmier/nvim/blob/2849b173b085201aaa43383116d23e095764e894/plugin/mini/00_mini.starter.lua\">config</a> with my new logo</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/747855/499485707-b8f055bd-fc78-43f5-9fd3-ceff173b3cc6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NTI2NjMsIm5iZiI6MTc5MzU1MjM2MywicGF0aCI6Ii83NDc4NTUvNDk5NDg1NzA3LWI4ZjA1NWJkLWZjNzgtNDNmNS05ZmQzLWNlZmYxNzNiM2NjNi5wbmc_.wO1XSKT3JoYmBeER2l2A2EJbD6kvNQzdmTM14mcjKLs\"><img width=\"795\" height=\"914\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-09 at 9 18 29 AM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/747855/499485707-b8f055bd-fc78-43f5-9fd3-ceff173b3cc6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NTI2NjMsIm5iZiI6MTc5MzU1MjM2MywicGF0aCI6Ii83NDc4NTUvNDk5NDg1NzA3LWI4ZjA1NWJkLWZjNzgtNDNmNS05ZmQzLWNlZmYxNzNiM2NjNi5wbmc_.wO1XSKT3JoYmBeER2l2A2EJbD6kvNQzdmTM14mcjKLs\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 914px;; aspect-ratio: 795 / 914; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
    "bodyText": "I'll get us started.\n\nThe colorscheme is miniwinter\nThe greeting changes from \"morning\", \"day\", and \"evening\" (\"borrowed\" from @echasnovski, thank you)\nThe quote at the bottom is from fortune and changes on startup\nMy mini.starter config with my new logo",
